Author: Ilkay Gül <igul@Mac.localdomain>
Date:   Mon Nov 16 03:17:52 2026 +0100

    droidvm: clipsync tray menu "Resolutie" (Automatisch, 1920x1080, 2560x1440, Schermeigen, 60/120 Hz) [skip ci]
    
    The choice is remembered (HKCU\Software\DroidVM Resolutie/Verversing) and
    re-applied at logon; a fixed size leaves C:\Users\Public\viogpu-vast so
    viogpuap stops following the window; the refresh rate is kept after every
    mode change. "clipsync.exe res <keuze> [hz]" does the same from a script.
    windows-vm.sh openen sends the screen's own size ("R w h") to clipsync's
    port 6202 (firewall: phone only). DPI stays automatic.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

